      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like a ghost. like i'm walking around and talking and pretending to be a person, but the actual \"me\"—the part that mattered, the one that actually had a future—is just dead. i'm just some biological machine running on old data and failed ambitions. it's so fucking exhausting to keep up the act when there's nothing actually inside anymore.",
